ed\" fields (TextField, NumberField, Select, DateField); presentationally it is a React Aria `Group`."],[372,"**`FieldInput`** — the single-line control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `Input` given antares spacing via `Box`)."],[370,"**`FieldLabel`** — names the field and flags whether it's required (wraps React Aria `Label`, rendering an optional `*` indicator)."],[373,"**`FieldTextArea`** — the multiline control the user types into (a normalized React Aria `TextArea` given antares spacing via `Box`)."],[375,"**`FieldTrigger`** — a full-width value-display button inside the box that opens an overlay (used by Select and DatePicker): a value area plus a trailing icon, laid out across the group. `variant=\"select\"` is transparent and input-like; `variant=\"control\"` is a filled segment inside a shared group."],[475,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[474,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[482,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[483,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[481,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[825,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[462,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[1263,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[467,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1096,"**Adornments**: Optional `leadingText` and `trailingText` for fixed text before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`)"],[871,"**A